<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">-Arum</book>
  <para style="h">AFISAWA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amgbasho Ablusu A na Afisawa mboh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Afisawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">A fi</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO BULUS A NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">AFISAWA MBOH</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Amgbasho Ablusu a na Afisawa mboh reh a jiji atsifa ma ikpi ndohmoh ata Nnoh a te reh, ata nza a tsana la Kristi a bu ma tohmoh. Amgbasho reh a kwere kyangwri Nnoh mboh la mata a dohsoh ikpi amoh mata a bu anyimbehreh nimeh Kristi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na Ablusu, kyangwri sa tohmoh nana Yeso Kristi na kira Nnoh,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">A na na amboh tufa Nnoh yehlehleh mboh nza ma a yama ma inzi Afisa, ma bu na nga agohsoh amoh na Yeso Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Andromboh alindeh tasa tuma alindeh ata nza anyi na Nnoh Ada ambohroh tasa Ada Yeso Kristi reh.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Te Atoh ata Huru Nimeh Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Riri a zohhoh na Nnoh tasa Ada Nnoh ambohroh Yeso Kristi, ata ŋoh reh kǝ te reh atoh na atoh ata nza anyi inza nimeh sa kristi reh. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />A jiji a seh reh meh ti bu kyangwri a ŋoh mboh nimeh sa kristi a treh feh sa a lisa inziyo areh, la meh ti bu na zanana, tasa amboh kpakpana kpeh ma tohmoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Nnoh a gu reh la meh ti bu mara a ŋoh mboh nimeh sa Yeso kristi, a lisa reh dehreh ni kira a ŋoh tasa ni nana agohsoh a ŋoh, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />a lisa dehreh la meh ti riri ndohmoh alindeh ata ŋoh nza a lisa reh were ma reh, nimeh sa amehreh a ŋoh ata ŋoh nza a kira na a ŋoh. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />La tsifa kwo Kristi Mbohroh meh ti hunji nvara ma atsi sangra mya a ŋoh, ta te kohhroh na kpakpana ambohroh, la tsifa kwini Nnoh nza a bu gaga, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />ata nza a fira a nga reh were tasa lomo ata ka a trina kpeh tasa wina lomo. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Nnoh a kira la Mbohroh meh ti wina ndohmoh ayuhu a ŋoh reh, ni kira a ŋoh, ata nza a lisa a bana reh la ndohmoh Yeso kristi ta a su. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />ata areh a bu na kira a ŋoh, la nza ameh a ŋoh kǝ tswa reh, mata a dohdohsoh awumu mboh nza ma a bu ma inza tasa inziyo reh nambri ma akpo anyimbehreh, na kira a ŋoh Yeso kristi reh.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Nimeh kristi, Nnoh tana a seh reh za la meh ti sa gohmoh ata ŋoh ta ka a bleh a gya la ŋoh wa a nati a nga reh reh, a lisa awumu mboh reh dehreh na kira a ŋoh, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />tsifa la mbohroh Yahudawa mboh, timi jiji gya agohsoh na ŋoh kristi, timi krumusu ndohmoh agbugba a ŋoh za. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />mohnoh amboh tufa mboh ma Afisawa mboh reh za tini sere nnoh tsifa ata a zizi reh, tsifa nana ata hunji nvara. Nza ni kira nnoh na Kristi reh, Nnoh a nga noh huru zanana ata ta ka a bleh noh a gya reh, ta a tsana mohnoh ni bu noh a ŋoh mboh. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Huru zanana reh a bu kpra la Nnoh a nati a nga reh gohmoh a ŋoh ata ta ka a bleh a gya reh, ata a nati ka a bu ambohroh ameh ata Nnoh a nati a sa amboh ata nza ma bu a ŋoh mboh a hwana reh. A lisa dehreh tsifa la meh ti ariri ŋoh tasa za meh ti nga ŋoh agba.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwende Tasa Kwehreh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Nza a bu dehreh mya nza ni sere la ni kira nnoh na Ada Yeso, tasa za la ni kira nnoh na amboh ata ma tufa Nnoh reh yehlehleh nambri. <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />Meh leh kwende Nnoh ni tutu tsifa amohnoh reh, meh leh kohnoh nnoh ma atsi kwere Nnoh amya. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Meh leh kwere la Nnoh Ada ambohroh Yeso kristi, Ada ata meh nga ŋoh agba, la ha ta nga noh Huru lomo tasa ata nza tohmoh, la ti lisa wina noh Nnoh reh alindeh. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Meh kwere Nnoh za la, ta a de zana a ŋoh a ba nimeh agohsoh amohnoh, la ti wina noh ha a ka bu mboh a bu gya agohsoh ata nza ma a fi noh ma kpi reh, tasa za la ti wina noh te atoh ata gohmoh nza ma a gya ma amboh tufa yehlehleh reh, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />tasa meh kwere Nnoh tsifa amohnoh la ti wina noh wuwana agba ata Nnoh reh na mbohroh meh ti leh kira na ŋoh ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh, a te ndohmoh a ŋoh na wuwana tsifa ambohroh, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />ata nza a te ndohmoh nimeh a ŋoh Kristi reh, tana a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo neh ka a gu ŋoh a gya na ni mgba ivoh rya a kpa ma atsi tuma a ŋoh ma inza. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Ma a huru reh ŋoh Kristi reh a nati a de Agohmoh agohgohmoh mboh na wuwana tasa wina de Agohmoh. A bu na sa ata nza a keh mgbiri sa mboh nza ma a nati a gya reh, a bu ma inziyo areh ma tsene kpeh, a nati a gu a na na inziyo ata ba za. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Nnoh reh a fira awumu mboh reh nambri a gya na ma hohroh hwana a ŋoh Yeso kristi reh, tasa a gyuru a seh Yeso kristi reh za a gya la ta a de awumu amboh areh nambri, ta a shingi amboh tufa mboh za nambri. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />amboh tufa mboh reh ma bu itoh Kristi, la tsifa mboh reh ta a su nambri.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Hunji Fene Nimeh Sa Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, tini kwo nnoh tsifa kpakpana amohnoh tasa sene tsifa amohnoh mboh, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />ata ti kǝ bu noh nimeh aki agugu reh, tini leh tufa nnoh akeki inziyo reh, ni tufa nnoh Agohmoh ata avereh inza, wohroh nza a bu huru agugu ata nza a ha kyangwri mboh tufa Nnoh. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Mbohroh timi kǝ rina Nnoh tswanza mboh nza maka a lisa reh. Meh lisa awumu ata agohsoh ambohroh a kira ta a lisa. mbohroh meh leh lisa awumu agugu mboh reh ata itoh ambohroh a kira tasa agohsoh ambohroh. Nza meh leh lisa dehreh reh, Nnoh a nati nga reh iya, tswanza nza a nati nga amboh agugu mboh iya reh. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Nnoh neh a bu na kwini gaga na ambohroh, kira a ŋoh za a bu gaga na ambohroh, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Mbohroh timi bu kohmoh mboh ma atsi kpakpana ambohroh, a bu tsifa kwini a ŋoh nza a nga reh nvara reh. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Tasa za Nnoh a yiri reh a hinga Mbohroh ma ŋoh Yeso kristi reh, tasa za ka a fira reh a gya la timi tuma de Agohmoh Mbohroh ma ŋoh ma inza, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Nnoh a lisa dehreh la ika ata nza a nati a ba ma tohmoh, ŋoh ta a tsana andromboh alindeh ata nza bu gaga ata nza a nati a trina kpeh. Andromboh alindeh a ŋoh reh, a tsana reh nimeh isa Yeso kristi. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />A bu ma aki ndohmoh alindeh Nnoh mohnoh nza ni hunji noh nvara ma aki nga agohsoh. Ata areh a bu na kira amohnoh kpeh, ma a nga noh were ma anyi na Nnoh, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />ni kama hunji noh nvara reh tsifa ndohmoh ata ni lisa noh na ikpi amohnoh kpeh, akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh ta kama a gu ikpi a ka ma inza kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Mbohroh meh bu ivoh ndohmoh Nnoh, a lisa reh nimeh sa Yeso Kristi timi lisa ndohmoh alindeh, ata Nnoh nza a lisa a gya reh timi lisa.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Meh Bu Anyimbehreh Nimeh Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Nza bu dehreh, kohnoh nza noh la mohnoh ni kiri tini bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh ma aki mara tasa za &lt;&lt;amboh shimba kpa&gt;&gt; ma a fi noh la, &lt;&lt;amboh kpa avu&gt;&gt; Ata areh bu shimba kpa ata itoh ata maka a lisa ni ivoh, <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />kohnoh nnoh na awumu amboh areh, ni kpikpi reh tini bu noh na ŋoh Yeso kristi reh kpeh, tini bu noh achifi mboh ma hohroh kyangwri Israila mboh, tini bu noh sene ni tsifa ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh reh. mohnoh nza ni yama nnoh ma inziyo areh ni bu noh na gya agohsoh tasa Nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Nehnehreh ni bu noh nimeh Yeso Kristi, mohnoh tini bu noh gbugba, nehnehreh ma a de noh a ba ma inda ma aki sangra imiya kristi reh.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Yeso Kristi na ikpi a ŋoh a bu tuma alindeh na ambohroh, ŋoh ata nza a dohsoh Yahudawa mboh tasa amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh ma akpo anyimbehreh, tasa za ka a druhu kukuchunu ata nza a hwashi mboh a gafa reh, ata areh a bu leke ata nza ma a leke itoh amoh reh, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />a gu akpi tasa kpi ashotoh a gya a tamba ma aki ata ŋoh nza a de akpi a ŋoh a ba reh. A lisa dehreh tsifa la ŋoh wa a lisa alohsoh afeh anyi anyina alohsoh afri, ma aki wohroh ŋoh a de tuma alindeh a ba nimeh ambohroh. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kristi reh a lisa dehreh la ŋoh ta ka a kpa mboh a suhru na afri ma amoh a ba na Nnoh, mata bu anyimbehreh, ma aki kwo a ŋoh ata nza ma a kpa ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh reh, ma a huru ka a lisa reh la timi kama nza itoh ambohroh mboh ma iyo kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Kristi a ba la ŋoh ta a ba ba ahwra akpi tsifa nana ata tuma alindeh a bleh noh, mohnoh amboh ata ni bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, mohnoh tini bu noh gbugba na Nnoh. A lisa ma Yahudawa mboh za ika wohroh, mboh nza ma a bu ma inda reh. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />A bu ma aki Kristi reh Mbohroh na afri ma ambohroh meh hunji aki anyimbehreh na na Ada, nza bu huru anyimbehreh,<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Nza bu dehreh, nehnehreh mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh Yahudawa mboh za kpeh reh, ni za bu noh achifi ha sehneh mboh za kpeh, ni sohroh chi nnoh atsi tuma kpeh, ni tswa ti tuma noh mohnoh ma amboh tufa Nnoh mboh, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />ma a mina ma ikpi chuhu tsifa amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso a bleh tasa kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh, mboh ma Yeso kristi reh ni ikpi a ŋoh a bu kpakpa gya chuhu mina . <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />A bu ŋoh wohroh mina reh na agba ma nza a dohsohna ma akpo anyimbehreh reh, ma aki wohroh kyangwri Nnoh mboh za mata a ba ma a gbo anyimbehreh tswanza ida kwere Ada Nnoh. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Tasa nimeh a ŋoh za ma a mina nnoh, ti bu noh atsi tuma Nnoh ma aki huru a ŋoh.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ablusu Kyangwri Hwra tsifa Nnoh A bleh Ma amboh Nza ma Bu Yahudawa mboh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh, mya Ablusu, kyangwri ata ma ta ka a de meh a ka ma ida a ka reh ma ikpi tsifa Yeso nza a tohmoh meh a ba la meh ti ba bu shingi nnoh mohnoh amboh nza ni bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh.<verse eid="EPH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Meh wina la mohnoh ni sehreh noh ma ikpi Nnoh nimeh agohsoh alindeh a ŋoh, nza nga meh, huru ata meh ti shi te ndohmoh ata nza a nati shingi nnoh, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />tswanza ta maka a bleh meh nimeh huru Nnoh reh na ayuhu andromboh ata ŋoh nza a kira, tswanza meh ti kǝ ŋa shidi mareh. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Nza ni bleh nza noh, ni nati wina noh andromboh ata mya nza ni wina ma ikpi tsifa huho ata Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Nnoh a tsana ma Kyangwri amboh ika ata anyi kpeh, tswanza nehnehreh Nnoh kǝ vuru ma amboh sa tohmoh nana a ŋoh mboh amboh nza ma a bu na Huru zanana tasa amboh sa tohmoh nyi na Nnoh a bleh. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Andromboh huho ata nza a bu nimeh tsifa nana ata Kristi, mboh amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, ma a tuma iziza gohmoh mboh ma Yahudawa. Mbohroh ma amoh meh kǝ bu tswanza avohvoh itoh anyimbehreh. Mboh za ma bu na avoh ndohmoh amoh nimeh andromboh alindeh Nnoh ta ka a bleh la ŋoh a nati nga reh nimeh Yeso Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Meh kǝ te ahwra ata bleh tsifa nana ata areh, a bu ngǝnga ata nza anyi na Nnoh a ba na amya nimeh ndohmoh ata wuwana a ŋoh. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Mya nza ni bu akehreh nimeh kyangwri Nnoh mboh, bu mya ma nga meh andromboh alindeh ŋoh, meh ti bleh ma amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh tsifa nana ata areh gaga ma ikpi Kristi, ata nza ma a nati wina bleh kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Ma a seh meh la meh ti bleh ma kyangwri mboh mata a wina tsifa Nnoh nza ka a lisa awumu ata huho, tasa anyi kiri tama a gya nimeh Nnoh, ata nza a lisa awumu mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />A bu kohnoh Nnoh nehnehreh la, nyi na duma amboh tufa mboh, mata a bleh lomo Nnoh ma atsetse a na ma amboh agbugba kpra tasa amboh wuwana ata inza mboh, <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />areh bu andromboh ata nza ma a lisa, ma ikpi kira ata Nnoh nza a kira nyi jiji ŋoh, a ka a lisa nimeh kristi Yeso Ada mbohroh. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Nimeh Kristi reh mbohroh meh bu na wuwa agohsoh na ni Nnoh gbehngehseh tasa ni kira agohsoh ambohroh. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Dehreh za, agohsoh amohnoh ta a hwa kpeh tsifa nza iya amya reh, meh nza iya ma ikpi amohnoh la ti hunji noh agba.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A kwere Nnoh Ma Ikpi Kyangwri Afisa Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh meh dohnoh ma tohmoh kwere Ada, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />alohsoh mboh nambri, amboh ata nza ma a bu ma inza tasa amboh nza ma a bu ma inzi ma a hunji sa amoh anyi na a ŋoh. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Meh kwere Nnoh la nimeh awumu gaga ata nga agba, a nati wina nga wuwa agohsoh na wuwana a ŋoh nyi nimeh huru a ŋoh nimeh anzoh, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />la Kristi ta aniye a tuma ma agohsoh amohnoh nimeh nga agohsoh. Meh kwere Nnoh la ti shi wuwana nnoh yivoh nimeh kira. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />la ti hunji noh wuwana, mohnoh ma mgbiri amboh zanana mboh, ti wina noh kira gaga ata Kristi, vuruna a ŋoh tasa izeh a ŋoh tasa agba a ŋoh, niye a ŋoh, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />tasa ti wina noh kira ata Kristi nza a bu na ambohroh reh, ata nza a keh wina mboh nambri, la kira Nnoh reh ta a su na ambohroh nambri.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />nehnehreh ŋoh nza a wina lisa andromboh ata nza a gǝga a keh andromboh ata kyangwri nza luhu ha la ta a kohnoh, nimeh wuwana a ŋoh ata nza a bu nimeh ndohmoh nimeh ambohroh. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Nnoh bu agba nimeh duma amboh tufa mboh tasa nimeh Kristi Yeso, ka a gu a na a te ika mboh areh nambri, a na atsi tuma atono. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Dohsoh Ikpi Nimeh itoh Yeso Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Meh kwere nnoh, mya nza bu nimeh ida ka ma ikpi Ada, meh kwere nnoh ti bu yehlehleh ma aki tufa na a zohhoh fi ata nza ma a fi noh. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Kǝ kuku nnoh ikpi amohnoh alindeh tasa ti bu noh amboh te ve tasa na soh ivoh yira, ti kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh nimeh kira. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Shi wuwana nnoh ti de noh ikpi amohnoh ta a bu anyimbehreh reh ata Huru nza a nga noh, dohsoh noh ikpi na itoh amohnoh nimeh tuma alindeh. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Itoh anyimbehreh a yama, Huru za a bu anyimbehreh tswanza mata ka a seh nnoh a ba ma ikpi gya agohsoh anyimbehreh reh, ata Nnoh nza a fi noh ma ikpi reh. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Ada anyimbehreh, gya agohsoh bu anyimbehreh, tasa za wra batisma bu anyimbehreh. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Nnoh za bu anyimbehreh tasa Ada Mbohroh nambri, ata nza a bu ma ikpi ambohroh nambri, ka a te ndohmoh na ambohroh nambri, a bu nimeh ambohroh nambri.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Kristi neh a ka a lisa reh alindeh nambri ma ambohroh, tswanza kristi nza a nza la a zohhoh ta nga reh. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />A bu tsifa wohroh reh nza ma ŋa a bleh ma amgbasho Nnoh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;&lt; Yeso ta ka a ka a na inza reh&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">ka a wa amboh ma ta ka a de mboh a ka mboh gaga reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">a nga ngǝnga ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh.<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Ka bu umbo nza ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A ka ma inza reh?&gt;&gt; Ma a tsana la, nyi ma jiji ŋoh kristi tana a tamba a ba ma inzizi ma inzi! <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />ŋoh ta ka a tamba reh, bu ŋoh mi nza a gyuru a ka na ŋoh inza mboh nambri, la wuwana Huru ŋoh ta a bu ma inza tasa inzi nambri. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />A bu ŋoh ŋa nza ta ka a tanga mgbiri kyangwri a nga mboh ndohmoh bleh tsifa nana reh, tasa mgbiri ka a nga mboh ndohmoh sa tohmoh anyi na Nnoh a ba ba a bleh reh, mgbiri ka a nga mboh hende hwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh a treh atsifi, itswa ka a nga mboh mata a te ndohmoh de ida Nnoh tasa amboh tsana, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />A lisa dehreh la ŋoh ta a lisa kyangwri Nnoh mboh la ndohmoh tsifa Nnoh ta rya tohmoh mata a mina itoh Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Ma a nati a rya tohmoh dehreh a nina nambri ma ambohroh meh ti bu anyimbehreh ata nga agohsoh, nimeh dohsoh ikpi, nimeh wina Amehreh Nnoh. meh nati bu kyangwri mboh na su, meh ti tuma agbugba mboh kristi nza a gya reh.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Ma a lisa dehreh la meh ti kama gyuruna te tswanza amehreh akǝkehreh mboh kpeh, ha la meh ti gyuruna te tswanza amboh nza maka a de mboh a kakama, inyo nza ka afo mboh a ba ivoh a mina tasa ivoh rya a kpa, maka a kira tsana mboh reh ha bu ika atamaa a na ma, amboh iyo amoh nza vuruna reh maka a leh a landa mboh la mata a hwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Uwa, la meh ti shi bleh zizi nimeh kira, meh ti te agba nimeh andromboh nza meh nati lisa meh ti gu agohsoh Kristi a bu ŋoh mi a bu ikpi ata itoh, kyangwri amboh tufa mboh. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />A bu ŋoh mi nza a de mgbiri itoh mboh reh nambri. Nza maka a dohsohna a de itoh amoh atsi te ndohmoh ariri mboh ma a sa, nimeh te ndohmoh ibǝba itoh mboh reh yehlehleh amboh tufa maka a lisa a te agba, a ka a lisa a te agba nimeh agohsoh kira.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuma nimeh Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Meh bleh noh ata areh, tasa, meh ti kpi nnoh ashotoh la kama bu noh tswanza amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh, amboh kohnoh abibi. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Agohsoh amoh bu kekete ma. Ma anyi mboh na fene ata Nnoh nza nga reh, tsifa duduna nza a bu nimeh amoh ma ikpi wuwa ikpi amoh. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Ma za a bu na isa kpeh. Ma a gu ikpi amoh a fi ma aki te abibi, maka te iyo atsi lisa awumu abibi mboh nambri.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Areh neh bu andromboh ata tama ka a tsana noh ma ikpi Kristi reh kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Meh wina la ma a bleh Nnoh tsifa mboh ma ikpi a ŋoh. tama a tsana noh a zizi ata nza na a bu nimeh Yeso. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Tama a tsana noh, ma ikpi hende amohnoh ata na amehmeh reh la, ni nati yi aki atono amohnoh reh ta nnoh, ata nza a de noh a te abibi tsifa kira awumu mboh ata huru tsifa, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />ti bu noh afeh nimeh kohnoh agohsoh amohnoh; <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />sene agohsoh amohnoh afeh ata tufa yehlehleh ata Nnoh nza a lisa nnoh.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Nza a bu dehreh la, ti sangra nnoh na huru tsifa, ha ba anyi ta ka bleh zizi ma atohngoh, nambri ma Mbohroh meh bu anyimbehreh nimeh Yeso Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Nza ni te nnoh gofo, kama kira nnoh gofo amohnoh reh ta a gu nnoh a fi a na ma kpakpana kpeh, Kama kira nnoh nnoh ta aniye la ni tre buti te gofo kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Tasa za kama nga noh ma agugu avu kpeh <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Ata nza ka te ayuhu ta za a te ayuhu kpeh, neh ta a shi ta a te ndohmoh, lisa andromboh alindeh na ivoh a ŋoh mboh, la ta a hunji andromboh ata nza a nati a shingi amboh ata nza ma a bu na wohroh kpeh.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Kama kira nnoh abibi tsifa mboh ta ka a kate anyi ma aniye amohnoh kpeh, neh ta ka a bu tsifa alilehndeh mboh ma ata nza a nati nga nnoh wuwana itoh ma ikpi andromboh ata nza ma a kira. Ma ikpi lisa dehreh tsifa amohnoh a nati a bu na shingi na amboh sere ŋoh. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Ti lisa nza noh feh, la ti kama kputu nnoh agohsoh ma Huru zanana ata Nnoh kpeh, wohroh a bu kpra tsana mi ata Nnoh a ba meh ikpi amohnoh ata nza a nati tsana ma ibi hwra akpi la mohnoh ni bu noh a ŋoh mboh mi. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Sangra nnoh na agohsoh ata agbiriri, tasa njwa, tasa gofo, mlana, tasa kputu isa, tasa hende de ma agohsoh. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Neh ti de noh itoh amohnoh alindeh ma, kǝ nza noh kwini itoh amohnoh, kǝ gu nnoh tsifa mboh te nnoh kohhroh ma itoh amohnoh tswanza Nnoh nza ka a gu amohnoh a te kohhroh nimeh Kristi reh.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Ni bu noh mara Nnoh mboh tasa za ŋoh a kira na amohnoh gaga, Nza a bu dehreh, ni nati bu noh tswanza ŋoh reh kanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Tasa za ti tuma noh na agohsoh kira na itoh amohnoh, tswanza kristi nza a kira reh tasa ta a gu itoh a ŋoh a nga iya ta a gu vari ambohroh tswanza wo yaha ngǝnga ata angǝshi alindeh ma Nnoh.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Nimeh amohnoh neh, akyo anyi ta a kama a leh ahohndoh na afya ata nza a sohroh a bu afiya a ŋoh kpeh, kama lisa nnoh andromboh abibi ikata wohroh kpeh. Kama kira nnoh andromboh gaga ma ikpi amohnoh mboh kpeh, la ta a nga noh nana. Wohroh a sohroh a bu andromboh ata kyangwri amboh tufa Nnoh mboh nza ma a nati a lisa kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kama bleh noh andromboh abibi kate nnoh ma aniye amohnoh kpeh, kama tsifa nnoh ma ikpi andromboh abibi kpeh, tswanza duduna mboh. Nza a bu dehreh neh, nimeh tsifa amohnoh, tsana noh la ni kwende Nnoh Nnoh. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Wina nnoh ata areh: Kyangwri ata nza a hehndeh a leh ahohndoh ha ata nza a lisa andromboh abibi, a sohroh a bu na gohmoh nimeh akpo afiya Nnoh tasa ata kristi a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Kama kira akyo ta a landa nnoh na tsifa duduna kpeh, a bu tsifa wohroh ŋa gofo Nnoh nza a nati a ba ma ikpi amboh ata nza ma a lisa ika ata wohroh. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Nza a bu dehreh kama lisa nnoh ikata amboh wohroh kpeh.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />mohnoh za tini bu noh ma shini. nehnehreh neh mohnoh ni bu noh kyangwri ada mboh. nehnehreh za mohnoh ni bu noh tswanza zana shira. Kǝ tuma noh tswanza mara zanana mboh. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />La zanana ka a shingi kyangwri ta a bu ma aki ata nza a bu alindeh, tufa yehlehleh, tasa zizi, <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />tasa ti fa nnoh akeki lisa andromboh ata Ada nza a kira. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Kama lisa nnoh andromboh abibi ikata kyangwri amboh ata agohsoh amoh nza a bu ma shini reh kpeh, neh ti kǝ tsana noh la andromboh amboh wohroh ma a bu abibi. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Kyangwri amboh ika wohroh mata a nza la a te mboh na isa ma ikpi andromboh ata nza ma a bleh la ma a lisa na ayuhu reh. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Nza nnoh ta a zana shira a ŋoh ma ikpi andromboh neh, kyangwri maka a nza andromboh wohroh a wina a zizi ŋoh kakende, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />a bu zana ŋa nza a de awumu mboh nambri a tsana kyangwri mboh. A bu tsifa wohroh ŋa nza ma a bleh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">&lt;&lt;Yiri hinga, nnoh kyangwri leh mla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">hinga nyi ma kwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Kristi a nati a de zana a ba ma ikpi anzoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Lisa nza feh, nimeh hende anzoh, ta a kama a bu tswanza amboh duduna kpeh neh, tswanza amboh wina lomo, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Inziyo ba abibi na ameh amboh ata areh, nza a bu dehreh, nza ni hunji aki lisa andromboh alindeh, lisa na wuwana anzoh nambri. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Nza a bu dehreh kama bu noh amboh duduna kpeh, neh ti wina noh andromboh ata Ada nza a kira ti lisa nnoh. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Kama te noh ifiya na amwo inabi kpeh, nza a nati a de noh a te abibi kpeh. Neh ta huru Nnoh ta a bu na amohnoh gaga. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Tsifa nnoh na itoh amohnoh nimeh ikata amgbasho Nnoh tasa amumu ata huru. Kpa nnoh amumu na agohsoh amohnoh nambri ma Ada,<verse eid="EPH 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />tasa ti kǝ kwende Nnoh Ada Nnoh na tutu na ikpi awumu mboh nambri, nimeh sa Yeso kristi. <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Tufa nnoh itoh amohnoh ta a tsana la ni nga nnoh agba ma kristi.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">ifiya Tasa Tsifa Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />ifiya mboh sehreh noh tsifa amohnoh mboh tswanza nza ni sehreh noh Ada reh. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Atsifa a bu agba ma tohmoh afya a ŋoh tswanza kristi nza a bu agba amboh tufa mboh, ata ŋoh nza a sa mboh anvara. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Tswanza amboh tufa mboh nza maka a tufa kristi reh, dehreh za ifiya mboh mata tufa tsifa amoh mboh ma awumu mboh nambri. <verse eid="EPH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Tsifa mboh, kira nnoh na ifiya amohnoh mboh, tswanza kristi nza a kira na amboh tufa mboh ta a gu ikpi a ŋoh a nga kwo tsifa wohroh reh <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />ta a de ŋoh a zanana tswanza kyangwri Nnoh mboh, ka tswanza a hwara reh na amwo, nza a de tsifa Nnoh a ba na ambohroh reh. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Tasa za kristi a lisa dehreh la ŋoh ta a de reh a ba na a ŋoh tswanza kyangwri alilehndeh a ŋoh mboh, nza ma a sohroh a bu na arishi ha andromboh anyi abibi ta a de ŋoh a te abibi ha mata a ŋa ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Dehreh za tsifa mboh mata a kira na ifiya amoh mboh tswanza ikpi amoh. kyangwri ata nza a kira na afya a ŋoh a tsana la ŋoh a kira na ikpi a ŋoh za. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Kyangwri nambri ma a kira na ikpi amoh mboh, ma ta ka nga ikpi amoh rya ma ta ka a sumu ŋoh, amboh tufa mboh reh a tswanza itoh Yeso ata ŋoh nza a ka a sumu ŋoh reh. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Mbohroh meh tswanza avohvoh itoh kristi reh. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Ma ikpi tsifa wohroh reh, nza atsifa kǝ sa afya a nati ata alehmeh tasa akre ta ka a handa na na afya a ŋoh reh, mboh afri reh maka a bu tswanza itoh anyimbehreh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Tsifa ayuhu ata areh a bu agba a nati a bu na iya ma kyangwri, mya meh tsifa ma ikpi la a tsana reh ma ikpi kristi tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh mi. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Dehreh za nambri ma amohnoh tsifa mboh ti kira nnoh ifiya amohnoh mboh tswanza ikpi amohnoh kanga. Tasa anyima afya nimeh amohnoh ta nga atsifa a ŋoh agba.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Amehreh Mboh Tasa Alehmeh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Amehreh mboh, nga nnoh atsiyoh amohnoh mboh agba nimeh Nnoh, ata areh a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Akpi Musa a bleh la &lt;&lt;Nga agba ma atsiyoh tasa atono&gt;&gt; Wohroh reh a bu akpi ata jiji ŋoh ma ta ka a bleh a gya reh <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />&lt;&lt;Ma bleh a gya la: &lt;Nza ni lisa dehreh, nnoh nati nza nana te yanda ma inziyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Ada mboh, kama lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a nati nga mara amohnoh mboh gofo kpeh. Neh, tsana mboh nnoh alindeh ma aki Nnoh.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahwra Tasa Ada Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />mohnoh amboh nza ni bu noh ahwra mboh, tufa nnoh tsifa agba amohnoh amboh inziyo ti kǝ nga mboh nnoh agba, tasa agohsoh a zizi, tswanza ni te noh ndohmoh ma kristi. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Kama te mboh nnoh ndohmoh la mata a kira nna amohnoh tsene kpeh, te noh ndohmoh alindeh na tutu tswanza ahwra kristi mboh, te noh ndohmoh ata Nnoh nza a kira. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Te nnoh ndohmoh ma agba amohnoh ata inziyo na agohsoh anyimbehreh. Kohnoh nnoh la ni te noh ndohmoh ma Ada amohnoh na ikpi a ŋoh, a sohroh a bu kyangwri kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Ni wina noh la Ada a nati a nga nga ma akyo ata nza a lisa andromboh alindeh. A nati a bu dehreh ha akyo wohroh a bu ahwra, ha a bu ahwra kpeh.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Agbugba mboh, lisa nnoh ma ahwra amohnoh mboh alindeh. Kama nga mboh nnoh iya kpeh, Wina nnoh la Ada amohnoh ata nza a bu ma inza a bu anyimbehreh, tasa a ka a sohroh a kira akyo anyi ta a yi anyi ata kpeh.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awumu Na Gofo Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Na trina amgbasho amya, meh kira meh ti bleh noh la: Dohsohna nnoh ni Nnoh ta nga noh wuwana a ŋoh. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Were nnoh akuri na gofo Nnoh ti shi wuwana nnoh na agugu nza a ba ti a landa nnoh reh. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Mbohroh meh sohroh de katsi na kyangwri mboh kpeh. Katsi ambohroh a bu na agbugba huru agugu amboh nza ma a bu agbugba ma shini inziyo ata areh. Meh de katsi na huru abibi amboh ata nza ma a bu ma inza tasa ma inzi. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Nza a bu dehreh, fira nnoh awumu na gofo ata Nnoh nza a nga reh, a bu awumu mlana amohnoh. la nza ameh abibi tana a ba, ni nati wina shi noh na wuwana. Nnoh a nati sohroh hwa nnoh kpeh. Nza tini tre noh awumu mboh nambri, ni nati shi noh na wuwana ma atsi amohnoh. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Nza a bu dehreh shi wuwana nnoh kanga. Areh a bu awumu mlana Nnoh ata nnoh nza ni nati were nnoh kanga: A zizi tsifa Nnoh a nati a bu tswanza rishi ata nza ni lafa chuhu yira. Kǝ lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a zohhoh. Wohroh a nati a bu tswanza gbugba ikpi ata nza a nati a shwa nnoh itoh amohnoh. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />tuma noh na la hwra tsifa nana ma ikpi tuma alindeh na Nnoh bleh. Wohroh reh a tswanza akpehtreh ma hwana amohnoh <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Tasa za, bu noh na nga agohsoh na Nnoh. Wohroh reh a nati a tswanza awumu mlana ata nza ni de noh ma ivoh amohnoh shwa mbeh. Ata nza a nati a shwa agugu ta a kama a hamba nnoh na awumu mlana a ŋoh nza a ba na shira reh kpeh. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Ta nvara ata Nnoh nza a nga noh ta bu tswanza gbugba hama ikpi mlana tasa ngǝnga ata Nnoh nza a nga noh nza a bu tswanza mbeh ata huru, nza a bu tsifa Nnoh. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Kǝ kwere nnoh Nnoh Ma huru na tutu, kwere nnoh Nnoh ta a shingi nnoh. Kwere nnoh ma ikpi awumu mboh nambri ata Nnoh nza a shingi nnoh aki kwere ma ikpi wohroh, lisa nza noh feh na tutu Tasa ti kǝ kwere nnoh Nnoh ma amboh tufa yehlehleh ma inziyo nambri.<verse eid="EPH 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Kavoh ma kwere nnoh Nnoh ma ikpi amya za, kwere nnoh Nnoh ta nga meh tsifa meh ti bleh ma kyangwri mboh. Kwere nnoh Nnoh la meh ti kama nyiri hwra tsifa nana Nnoh bleh kpeh. Kwere nnoh Nnoh la meh ti wina bleh a zizi tsifa Nnoh bleh kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Nnoh kǝ tohmoh meh la meh ti sa tsifa nana a ŋoh bleh kyangwri mboh tswanza kyangwri nza a sa aniye Yeso a bleh. A bu tsifa wohroh ŋa mya nza ni bu ma ida ka areh. Kwehreh nnoh Nnoh la meh ti kama nyiri shi bleh tsifa a ŋoh na agohsoh anyimbehreh, twanza nza a zohhoh meh ti bleh reh kpeh.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu Ka A bleh tsifa A ŋoh Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Meh nati tohmoh atsi ambohroh Takiku ata nza meh kira, ŋoh a nati a bleh noh ma ikpi amya. Ŋoh nza a bu ahwra Nnoh nza a te ndohmoh alindeh. Ni nati wina noh andromboh ata nza meh lisa tasa za ha meh kǝ yama lele? <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />A bu tsifa wohroh ŋa mya nza ni tohmoh ŋoh ba na amohnoh reh. Meh kira ta a bleh noh ha Mbohroh meh yama lele na mareh, la mohnoh te hunji noh wuwana. <verse eid="EPH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Nnoh Ada tasa Ada Yeso kristi ta nga noh mohnoh atsi mboh nambri tuma alindeh, kira tasa nga agohsoh. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Nnoh ta a lisa alindeh ma akyo ata nza a kira na Ada ambohroh Yeso kristi na tutu Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>